Interoperability
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The printer's command set is documented in PROTOCOL.md. It was determined by
examining the vendor's own publicly distributed Windows application, for the sole
purpose of interoperating with hardware the author owns and which the vendor
supplies no software to drive on the author's platform.

This repository contains no code, binaries, assets or documentation belonging to
MangoSlab Co., Ltd. What PROTOCOL.md records are facts about a wire protocol —
byte values, identifiers and message layouts — together with the author's own
prose. Facts of that kind are the substance of any independent implementation.

